(7661135, 1248580, 124815, '<td valign="top">Quite an accomplishment (Lev) - hard to critique unless compared directly with Rubens where the blue as background for the hands was a little marvel and not so central to the composition. You made a more cheerful tableau where the old woman is not brooding. The lighting is astonishing. <br/>Better than playing charade! But oh boy so much more complicated. <br/>Call it inspired by rubens</td>', 'Quite an accomplishment (Lev) - hard to critique unless compared directly with Rubens where the blue as background for the hands was a little marvel and not so central to the composition. You made a more cheerful tableau where the old woman is not brooding. The lighting is astonishing. Better than playing charade! But oh boy so much more complicated. Call it inspired by rubens', '2020-05-03 00:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
